                  "size": 2.6,
                  "content": "**19%**",
                  "step": 0
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "small",
                  "content": "fewer 22-to-25-year-olds in AI-exposed jobs than if they had kept pace with their less exposed peers.",
                  "step": 0
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": false,
                  "size": "small",
                  "start": 1,
                  "progressive": false,
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "content": "No such gap for experienced workers."
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "Less hiring, not lay-offs."
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "No job losses across the whole economy."
                    }
                  ],
                  "step": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "small",
                  "content": "One reading: AI takes the junior tasks first. Rival readings: post-Covid over-hiring, high interest rates, a weak market.",
                  "step": 2
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "step": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "normal",
          "content": "**Whatever the cause, it lands where you start.**",
          "align": "center",
          "step": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "tiny",
          "content": "Brynjolfsson, Chandar and Chen (Stanford), August 2026. US payroll data to June 2026. Descriptive, not causal.",
          "step": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "why-you",
      "hidden": false,
      "layout": "auto",
      "background": null,
      "header": "",
      "aside": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "print": "",
      "steps": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "title",
          "content": "Why you in particular",
          "step": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "start": 1,
          "progressive": true,
          "size": "normal",
          "items": [
            {
              "content": "**Your first job is made of text.** The summary, the briefing note, the first draft. That is what these models do best.",
              "step": 0
            },
            {
              "content": "**Your biggest employer is short of money.** Governments must do more with fewer staff. A model is cheaper than a civil servant.",
              "step": 1
            }
          ],
          "step": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "normal",
          "content": "**The budget that brings AI in is the budget that hires you.**",
          "step": 2,
          "align": "center"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rather-not",
      "hidden": false,
      "layout": "auto",
      "background": null,
      "header": "",
      "aside": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "print": "",
      "steps": 4,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "title",
          "content": "Abstention is a losing strategy",
          "step": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "columns",
          "widths": [
            1,
            1
          ],
          "valign": "top",
          "columns": [
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "normal",
                  "content": "**Fair worries**",
                  "step": 0
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": false,
                  "size": "normal",
                  "start": 1,
                  "progressive": false,
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "content": "The energy it burns."
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "The jobs it takes."
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "The firms that own it."
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "What it does to learning."
                    }
                  ],
                  "step": 0
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "normal",
                  "content": "**Abstention**",
                  "step": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "list",
                  "ordered": false,
                  "size": "normal",
                  "start": 1,
                  "progressive": true,
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "content": "It tells your friends who you are.",
                      "step": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "It tells the labs nothing.",
                      "step": 2
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "It changes nothing (h/t Mancur Olson).",
                      "step": 3
                    }
                  ],
                  "step": 1
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "step": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "normal",
          "content": "**You can't shape what you don't understand. You can't understand it if you don't use it.**",
          "align": "center",
          "step": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "two-ways",
      "hidden": false,
      "layout": "auto",
      "background": null,
      "header": "",
      "aside": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "print": "",
      "steps": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "title",
          "content": "Two ways to lose",
          "step": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "columns",
          "widths": [
            1,
            1,
            1
          ],
          "valign": "top",
          "columns": [
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "normal",
                  "content": "**Refuse it**",
                  "step": 0
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "small",
                  "content": "You never learn the tool. The work moves on without you.",
                  "step": 0
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "normal",
                  "content": "**Learn with it**",
                  "step": 2
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "small",
                  "content": "You can do more, and you can still judge it.",
                  "step": 2
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "normal",
                  "content": "**Lean on it**",
                  "step": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "small",
                  "content": "You never learn the skill. You can't tell when it is wrong.",
                  "step": 1
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "step": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "normal",
          "content": "**Don't refuse it. Don't lean on it.**",
          "align": "center",
          "step": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coach",
      "hidden": false,
      "layout": "auto",
      "background": null,
      "header": "",
      "aside": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "print": "",
      "steps": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "title",
          "content": "Sneakers, steroids or a coach",
          "step": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "columns",
          "widths": [
            1,
            1,
            1
          ],
          "valign": "top",
          "columns": [
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "src": "img_aj1_sq.jpg",
                  "width": "100%",
                  "fit": "cover",
                  "caption": "",
                  "step": 0,
                  "focus": "center"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "normal",
                  "content": "**Sneakers**",
                  "step": 0
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "small",
                  "content": "Better kit. You run faster, and it is still you running.",
                  "step": 0
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "small",
                  "content": "*Search. Formatting. The boring code.*",
                  "step": 0
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "src": "img_armstrong_sq.jpg",
                  "width": "100%",
                  "fit": "cover",
                  "caption": "",
                  "step": 1,
                  "focus": "center"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "normal",
                  "content": "**Steroids**",
                  "step": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "small",
                  "content": "Fast now. You never get stronger.",
                  "step": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "small",
                  "content": "*Handing over the thinking you came here to learn.*",
                  "step": 1
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "image",
                  "src": "img_coach_sq.jpg",
                  "width": "100%",
                  "fit": "cover",
                  "caption": "",
                  "step": 2,
                  "focus": "center"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "normal",
                  "content": "**A coach**",
                  "step": 2
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "small",
                  "content": "Makes you better even when it is not there.",
                  "step": 2
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "size": "small",
                  "content": "*Explain this. Attack my draft. Quiz me.*",
                  "step": 2
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "step": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "tiny",
          "content": "Photos: Smithsonian (CC0); Gawain78 (public domain); Steffen Prößdorf (CC BY-SA 4.0). Wikimedia Commons.",
          "step": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "manager",
      "hidden": false,
      "layout": "auto",
      "background": null,
      "header": "",
      "aside": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "print": "",
      "steps": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "title",
          "content": "Think like a manager",
          "step": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "size": "normal",
          "start": 1,
          "progressive": true,
          "items": [
            {
              "content": "**Using AI well is management.** You tell the agents what to do, and what works and what does not."
            },
            {
              "content": "**Managers need taste.** It takes years of doing the work. Lean on AI too early and you never build it.",
              "step": 1
            }
          ],
          "step": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "normal",
          "content": "**You cannot manage work you never learned to do.**",
          "align": "center",
          "step": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "tiny",
          "content": "h/t Ethan Mollick (Wharton).",
          "step": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "beyond",
      "hidden": false,
      "layout": "auto",
      "background": null,
      "header": "",
      "aside": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "print": "",
      "steps": 4,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "title",
          "content": "Don't wait for us",
          "step": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "size": "normal",
          "start": 1,
          "progressive": true,
          "items": [
            {
              "content": "**Use it every day.** It moves too fast to understand from the outside."
            },
            {
              "content": "**Build one small thing** with AI this term. Then find where it fails.",
              "step": 1
            },
            {
              "content": "**Let us teach what does not expire:** validity, causal inference, institutions.",
              "step": 2
            }
          ],
          "step": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "normal",
          "content": "**Use these tools well, and you are limited only by your ambition.**",
          "align": "center",
          "step": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "small",
          "content": "Conditional on a job market still existing.",
          "step": 4,
          "align": "center"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "checkable",
      "hidden": false,
      "layout": "auto",
      "background": null,
      "header": "",
      "aside": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "print": "",
      "steps": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "title",
          "content": "Where AI already shines",
          "step": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "size": "normal",
          "start": 1,
          "progressive": true,
          "items": [
            {
              "content": "**Tasks you can check.** A maths proof. Code that passes its tests. Here AI is already very good.",
              "step": 0
            },
            {
              "content": "**Politics has no answer key.** Did the policy work? What do voters want? Nothing to check against.",
              "step": 1
            }
          ],
          "step": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "normal",
          "content": "**Nothing to check? Then someone has to judge.**",
          "align": "center",
          "step": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "tiny",
          "content": "Gold-medal level at the International Mathematical Olympiad: OpenAI and Google DeepMind, July 2025.",
          "step": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "one-week",
      "hidden": false,
      "layout": "auto",
      "background": null,
      "header": "",
      "aside": "",
      "speaker": "",
      "print": "",
      "steps": 0,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "title",
          "content": "One researcher, one week"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "size": "normal",
          "start": 1,
          "progressive": true,
          "items": [
            {
              "content": "**Every law passed in the OECD, 2000–2025.** Collected, processed and analysed.",
              "step": 0
            },
            {
              "content": "**Every IMF document.** Scraped and searched for evidence of a mechanism I theorised.",
              "step": 1
            },
            {
              "content": "Developed a sick set of slides for both projects.",
              "step": 2
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "size": "normal",
          "content": "**Learn to do this, and you are the whole research team.**",
          "align": "center",
          "step": 3
        }
      ]
    },
